@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName "Liberation Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontStyle bold
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam titleFontStyle bold

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ArrowThickness 2.5
skinparam ArrowFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowFontStyle bold

skinparam ActivityBorderColor black
skinparam ActivityBorderThickness 2.5
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam ActivityFontSize 14
skinparam ActivityFontStyle bold

skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor black
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderThickness 2.5
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontSize 13
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontStyle bold

title Module 6: High-Fidelity Fact-Check Card Browser-Native SVG Rasterization Pipeline

start

:Verified Claim Dossier Resolved;
note right
  - Unique Case ID (e.g. #FS-202608-0104)
  - Majority Verdict (TRUE/FALSE/MISLEADING)
  - Weighted Confidence Score (C: 0 - 100%)
  - Quorum Count (N >= 3 Verifiers)
  - Top Cited Evidence Domains
end note

:Mount FactCheckCard.tsx Component (540x540px DOM);
note right
  - Saffron Sleek Brand Header
  - Truncated Claim Text (<= 150 chars)
  - Chromatic Rubber-Stamp Verdict Badge
  - Circular SVG Trust Meter
  - Permanent Dossier Verification URL
end note

:User Clicks "Download WhatsApp Card";

:Invoke html-to-image Engine with Options;
note right
  - pixelRatio: 2 (2x Super-Sampling)
  - cacheBust: true
  - backgroundColor: #FFFBF5
end note

:Deep-Clone Target DOM Node Tree;

:Wrap Cloned HTML into SVG <foreignObject> Container;

:Inline External Web Fonts & Brand Assets as Base64 Data URLs;

:Dispatch SVG Document to Browser Native C++ Rendering Engine;
note right
  - Blink / Skia (Chromium)
  - WebKit / CoreGraphics (Safari)
  - Gecko / WebRender (Firefox)
  - Native CSS Color Level 4 (OKLCH/OKLAB) Support
end note

:Rasterize SVG onto High-Resolution HTML5 Canvas (1080x1080px);

:Execute Canvas.toDataURL('image/png') / toBlob();

:Generate Download Anchor & Trigger Client-Side File Save;
note right
  - File: factstamp-[claim-id].png
  - High-DPI WhatsApp-Ready Visual Counter-Measure
end note

stop
@enduml
